# Loaded by `vite build` (`make build`). Committed — public, non-secret values only.
# Vite inlines `VITE_`-prefixed vars into the client bundle.
# The API is called through this site's own address: vercel.json forwards /api/*
# to the API project, so the session cookie belongs to this site and sign-in
# works on any domain, *.vercel.app included. To call the API's own host
# instead, put its URL here; it must then share this site's domain (say
# api.example.com for internal.example.com) and list this site in CORS_ORIGINS.
VITE_API_URL=/api
